# Fevered Visions (CR 513.1, 603.2): at each player's end step that player draws a card, and only an opponent with four or
# more cards in hand afterwards takes 2 damage. Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and draws at Bot1's own end step with no damage
# (Bot1 is not the opponent); at Bot2's end step Bot2 casts four Ornithopters, so it holds three cards, draws to exactly
# four - the limit's own number - and takes exactly 2. Bot1 too holds four cards after its own end-step draw (three left
# after casting, one drawn), so it is the "your opponent" condition alone that spares it; on turn 3 its draw step and the
# Island played leave it at four, three had its own end step not drawn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Fevered Visions
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x16

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fevered Visions.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play

[Expect]
? Bot2.Life = 18
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 4
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
